---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site.mjs';

const updated = '18 February 2025';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy"
  description="How this bank statement converter handles your data: your statement is processed in your browser and never uploaded. What analytics run, what cookies are used, and how to contact us."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="page prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="small muted">Last updated {updated}.</p>

      <div class="note note--info">
        <strong>The short version.</strong> Your bank statement is opened and converted by JavaScript running in your own
        browser tab. It is never uploaded to us, never stored, and never seen by anyone but you. You can verify this
        yourself in your browser's network tab while converting a file.
      </div>

      <h2>Your statement files</h2>
      <p>
        We do not receive your PDF, OFX or QFX files, or anything derived from them. There is no upload endpoint on this
        site, no storage bucket and no processing queue. The conversion happens entirely on your device, and the
        resulting spreadsheet is written directly to your downloads folder by your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        Because nothing is transmitted, there is nothing for us to delete, disclose, sell or lose. If you convert a file
        while offline after the page has loaded, everything still works — which is the simplest possible demonstration
        that the file is not being sent anywhere.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and does not fingerprint visitors. It records aggregate page
        views, referrers, country and basic device information. It cannot identify you, and because it sets no cookies it
        does not require a consent banner in the EU or UK.
      </p>
      <p>
        We deliberately do not run Google Analytics or any other cookie-based analytics product on this site, and we do
        not use session recording, heatmaps or advertising pixels to profile individual visitors.
      </p>

      <h2>Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        This site may display advertising supplied by Google AdSense. Where ads are shown, Google and its partners may
        use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can
        control personalised advertising through{' '}
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>, and you
        can opt out of third-party vendor cookies at{' '}
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">aboutads.info</a>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Where required by law, we ask for consent before any non-essential cookies are set, and you can decline without
        losing access to the converter. Advertising never has access to your statement file, because the file never
        leaves your device.
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate links</h2>
      <p>
        Some links to OCR services for scanned statements are affiliate links, marked with <code>rel="sponsored"</code>.
        If you follow one and buy something, we may receive a commission at no extra cost to you. These links never
        appear inside the converter, and they never receive data about the file you were working on.
      </p>

      <h2>Server logs</h2>
      <p>
        The site is served by a static hosting provider, which keeps standard request logs (IP address, user agent,
        requested URL) for security and abuse prevention. Those logs relate to page requests, never to the contents of
        any file you convert, which is not transmitted at all.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>This site is a tool for handling financial documents and is not directed at children.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Because we do not collect personal data from the converter and use no identifying cookies, there is generally
        nothing to access, correct or erase. If you believe we hold data about you, contact us and we will investigate and
        respond within 30 days. If you are in the EU or UK, you also have the right to complain to your national data
        protection authority.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        If this policy changes — for example if a paid batch conversion service is added, which would require sending
        files to a server — the change will be described here, with the trade-offs stated plainly, before that feature is
        enabled.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy: <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
